---
title: Governed-Remediation workflow loop (design view). Dashed = planned (M4), not built.
---
flowchart TD
  START(["Starts with a session, a deploy or a new SARIF report"])
  N1["1. Scan<br/>Jenkins: code and live app"]
  N2["2. Create tickets<br/>Ticket agent, one per file, line and CWE<br/>Ticket store: GitHub Issues"]
  N3["3. Triage<br/>Verdict comment: real, likely false positive, needs a human<br/>planned (M4)"]
  N4["4. Fix<br/>OpenHands fixer agent"]
  N5["5. Review and verify<br/>Reviewer agents and Jenkins"]
  N6["6. Approve and merge<br/>Human only"]
  N7["7. Deploy<br/>Jenkins, to production"]
  N8["8. Confirm<br/>Exploit fails, scan is clean"]
  N9["9. Issue closes<br/>GitHub, when a merged PR body has a closing keyword<br/>Not a controlled step: known risk, no check yet"]
  MEM[("Memory ledger and cross-reference comments<br/>Decisions from collaborators only<br/>planned (M4)")]
  HUM["Human makes every dismissal"]

  START --> N1 --> N2 --> N3 --> N4 --> N5 --> N6 --> N7 --> N8 --> N9
  N9 -->|next scan| N1
  N2 -.->|match to an earlier ticket| MEM
  MEM -.->|evidence only| N3
  N9 -.->|record the outcome| MEM
  N3 -.->|likely false positive| HUM

  classDef planned fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#534AB7,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:6 4,color:#26215C
  classDef human fill:#E1F5EE,stroke:#0F6E56,color:#04342C
  class N3,MEM planned
  class N6,HUM human
  linkStyle 10,11,12,13 stroke:#534AB7,stroke-dasharray:6 4
